  "title": "PFCP: optionally decode hf_pfcp_bbf_ppp_lcp_magic_number_rx",
  "description": "The latest spec TR-459i3 §6.9.8 contains:\n\n> Rx Magic Number\n>   Only present if length >=10 and encode a PPP LCP Magic Number as defined in RFC 1661 [34].\n>   When present, received LCP keepalive messages need to verify against this magic number. When not\n>   present (length < 10), magic numbers are not verified.",
